    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Ɣidh-ki-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa ruëc tok a tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bäŋuan. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Ä-bi-yaa nya Dhɛ-kar-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni cuŋ nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, ce̱tnikɛ tëë diaal tëë ca la̱t ɛ gua̱n ni Dee-bid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yiëc Luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ruɔ̱n ruëc Ɣidh-ki-yaa min nhiam kɛ pay in jio̱liɛn, cuɛ thiekni luaak Kuɔth lɛp, kä cuɛ kɛ nyɔk kɛ lätni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ bööth palä kɛnɛ ji̱ Lii-bay nööŋ, kä cuɛ kɛ ben dol kui̱ käny ca̱ŋ rɛy kal luaak Kuɔth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Liɛŋɛ ɣä, ji̱ Lii-bay! Ɛn täämɛ lɛ̈yɛ rɔ̱, kä yiacɛ luak Kuɔth Nhial, Kuoth guuri, naŋɛ jiäk raar guäth in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö gua̱nikɔn /kenkɛ ŋa̱th, ca la̱t ni jiäk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdan. Cikɛ Kuoth Nhial pa̱l ruëëc, /kenkɛ wi̱cdiɛn luɔc guäth cieŋä Kuɔth Nhial, cikɛ riet ni jɛ jɔkdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cikɛ ga̱k ni thiekni luaak kä thi̱n, kä ca yieny ni lɛmbäri, kä /ka̱n wäl in kur kur waŋ, kä thilɛ muc in waŋkɛ mi ca thöp Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl guäth in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ci kɛ̈c Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cɛ kɛ jak kä ti diɛɛr kä dual kä ga̱y, ce̱tkɛ mi guɛcɛ jɛ mi kɛ nyinkun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c kä nɛmɛ, ɛ jɛn mëë na̱kɛ gua̱nikɔn, kä tekɛ gaatkɔn kɛ mänkɔn pecä mɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ ca lar ɛn ɣöö bakɔ ruac mat kɔnɛ Kuoth Nhial, Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl, dɔ̱ŋ bi kɛ̈cdɛ jiɛn kä kɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ gaatkä /cuarɛ te talaaŋä, kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial yɛ mɛk, kɛ ɣöö bia lät nhiamdɛ, kä bia wa̱ŋ wal tin kuɔ̱r kuɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä bia naath böth mi palkɛ jɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyɔak Nath kɛ pal rɛy luaak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu kuäär ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa keer nikɛ runwaŋ, kä cuɛ bööth wec diaal dol, kä cukɛ wä luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ thääk bärɔw kɛ rueeth rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw kɛ dɛy rɔɔmni da̱ŋ bärɔw, kɛ thääk deet böwni da̱ŋ bärɔw nööŋ, kɛ ɣöö bakɛ thöp ala muc dui̱rä kɛ kui̱ kuäärä kɛnɛ kui̱ ji̱ Juda. Kä cuɛ bööth pala tin la gaat Ä-ron jiök i̱ thöpɛ kɛ wi̱i̱ yi̱kä Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ thääk näk, kä cu bööth palä riɛm ka̱n, kä cua jɛ wä kiɛth wi̱i̱ yi̱kä. Kä cukɛ rueeth rɔɔmni nääk, kä cua riɛmdiɛn kiɛth wi̱i̱ yi̱kä. Kä cukɛ dɛy rɔɔmni näk, kä cua riɛmdiɛn kiɛth wi̱i̱ yi̱kä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua thääk deet böwni tin la nyin dui̱rä nööŋ nhiam kua̱r kɛnɛ ji̱ dolä, kä cukɛ kɛ buk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth palä kɛ näk, kä cua riɛmdiɛn ben wuɔc wi̱i̱ yi̱kä, luɛlkɛ jɛ dueer nɛɛni diaal. Kɛ ɣöö ci kuäär ɛ lar i̱ muc in waŋkɛ kɛnɛ muc kɛ kui̱ dui̱rä, bä kɛ la̱t kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa ji̱ Lii-bay ka̱m la̱t rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial kɛ thuɔmni ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca la̱rɛ ɛ Muthɛ kɛnɛ gökdɛ ni Gad kɛ gök Kuɔth ni Na-than. Ɛn nɛmɛ laarɛ Kuoth Nhial kɛ thok göökni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Lii-bay cuɔ̱ŋ kɛ thuɔmni ti cät kɛ nyin Dee-bid, kä cu bööth palä cuɔ̱ŋ kɛ kaaŋni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär wee, ɛ muc tin waŋkɛ thöpkɛ wi̱i̱ yi̱kä. Kä min tuɔkɛ muc tin waŋkɛ kɛ thöp, kä cua diit puɔnyä Kuɔth tok bä, kä cua thuɔmni kɛnɛ kaaŋni cu puɔ̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal pal, kä kɛtkɛ diit ɛ ji̱ kët din, kä cu jɔw kaaŋä cu päl. Kä cu kɛn ti diaal ti̱ti̱ te thi̱n amäni mëë ci muc in waŋkɛ thuɔ̱k kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci muc thuɔ̱k, cu kuäär kɛnɛ nɛy tin te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ rɔ goŋ kɛ pal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär kɛnɛ bööth ji̱ Lii-bay jiök i̱ puanyɛ Kuoth Nhial kɛ diit tëë gɔ̱a̱rkɛ ɛ Dee-bid kɛnɛ gok ni A-thap. Kä cukɛ diit puɔnyä kɛt kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac, kä cukɛ rɔ goŋ palkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa wee, “Ɛn täämɛ cia rɔ lëy Kuoth Nhial. Biakɛ kä nööŋɛ luuri, kɛnɛ muc tɛthkä lɔaac rɛy luaak Kuɔth.” Kä cu duɔl luuri kɛnɛ muc tɛth kä lɔaac nööŋ. Kä ramɔ luäŋ duɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ nööŋɔ kɛ ca̱r lɔaacdɛ a jɛ nööŋ muc in waŋkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu pek mucni tin waŋkɛ tin ca nööŋ ɛ duɔl, cu ka thääk ti jiɛn bärɔw, kɛ rueeth rɔɔmä ti kuɔ̱r, kɛ dɛy rɔmni ti kur rɛw. Kɛn ti̱ti̱ kɛn diaal kɛ muc tin waŋkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu muc tin ca lɛy pekdiɛn a thääk ti kur bäkɛl, kɛ det ti bathdɔɔri diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu bööth palä kuɛ̈ɛ̈, /ca muc diaal tin waŋkɛ dëë luäŋ kɛ jiëŋ. Kä cu ji̱ Lii-bay rɔ̱ lɛy, kä cukɛ kɛ luäk, amäni mëë ci la̱t thuɔ̱k. (Kɛ ɣöö ji̱ Lii-bay ŋa̱th nikɛn kä bööth palä kɛ lëy pua̱nynikiɛn.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ gek mucni tin waŋkɛ, cuɛ tekɛ? Thio̱o̱l mucni nyuaakä, kɛ muc kɔŋä tin thöpkɛ kɛɛl kɛ muc tin waŋkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu pal rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial cu loc thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa kɛnɛ nɛy diaal lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth kɛ luäk kɛ lätni kä ti̱ti̱ diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
